  "title": "Drunken Grilled Asparagus",
  "description": "Fresh asparagus is marinated in a Burgundy wine mixture for several hours, then cooked on the grill. This is a great way to enjoy the springtime harvest! Arrange the asparagus around your entree, and grill them at the same time.",
